            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0403" n="279" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg279"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 F 861/134: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Frazier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-11-30T14:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 30,
                                1921—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:10
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>215. My telegram number 212, November 26, 12 noon.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d234-f1"
                    /> Austrian Government recognized me as Chargé d’Affaires and received me as
                    such November 26th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crazier</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
